    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considerable Grandfather is on the hunt for Creek, his dearest dog &amp; best friend, who went missing during an overnight break-in by the Molemen, a collective of organized humanoid moles, scavenging for equipment to contribute to their unknown device.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Rescue Boggies!</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of most stages in a given location is to rescue all of the stray Boggies. Bring them to the Boggie Door to save them &amp; get them on the path back to their homes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Dig Holes!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty iron shovel to dig holes in the dirt to trap enemies, take shortcuts, or reach inaccessible areas! You can't dig through rock though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Survive.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that the Boggies are safe, you must save yourself next. Be careful out there on your way to the Exit Door! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best Friends Don't Let Each Other Down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put retirement aside. Your good boy needs you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considerable Grandfather is on the hunt for Creek, his dearest dog &amp; best friend, who went missing during an overnight break-in by the Molemen, a collective of organized humanoid moles, scavenging for equipment to contribute to their unknown device.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Rescue Boggies!</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of most stages in a given location is to rescue all of the stray Boggies. Bring them to the Boggie Door to save them &amp; get them on the path back to their homes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/34ca485c08dbff1d3ba89365f399753d.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Dig Holes!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty iron shovel to dig holes in the dirt to trap enemies, take shortcuts, or reach inaccessible areas! You can't dig through rock though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/75b7a473bea76e4ffdfa72ef3d4d0c1f.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Survive.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that the Boggies are safe, you must save yourself next. Be careful out there on your way to the Exit Door! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.poster.avif?t=1753855663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.webm?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/e63a6f90add02bf5abc54e11e7585959.mp4?t=1753855663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best Friends Don't Let Each Other Down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put retirement aside. Your good boy needs you.</p>",
